title: Credential page behind a CAPTCHA gate
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: phishing, evasion
attack: T1497, T1566.002
description: A CAPTCHA/Turnstile gate preceded a credential prompt on a non-allowlisted host:
  antibot gating used to keep crawlers off the harvester.
---
capture
// A CAPTCHA or Turnstile gate was seen this session ...
| where signal("capture.gated") == true
// ... and a credential prompt: a brand sign-in, a Microsoft sign-in clone, or any
// password form ...
| where signal("brand.credential_prompt") == true
    or exists(ms_clone_pages)
    or signal("forms.password_forms") > 0
// ... on a site that is not allowlisted.
| where signal("final.allowlisted") != true
| project final_url = signal("final.url")
